# Keep the Railway/Docker build context small: the image only needs
# swarm-harness/requirements.txt + swarm-harness/app/ + swarm-harness/worker/.
# Everything else here is tooling, docs, or local state — no effect on the image.
.git
.github
.venv
.venv-test
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.DS_Store
examples
scripts
/*.md
docker-compose.yml
k8s-deployment.yaml
swarm-harness/docker-compose.yml
swarm-harness/k8s-deployment.yaml
swarm-harness/tests
